# Classroom Context

#### This is the fourth unit of the course, building off the content from units one through three. The course was designed to teach in order.

#### Teachers serve as guides supporting **design thinking, encouraging responsible AI use, and helping students interpret and improve AI-generated work**.


## Unit Length and Format

#### **Total Duration:** Approximately 3 weeks
#### **Structure:** Eleven 45-minute lessons and one 5-day culminating project

